dware boxes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/cloudflare-inc-net-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"NET 2022 Q1","e":"net","d":"2022-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"…IT budgets and where many other vendors are trying to figure out how they can either hold or raise prices, I think we can continue to be pushing forward and taking share and especially taking that high-margin share from both existing hardware vendors who are having a hard time even…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/cloudflare-inc-net-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"NET 2022 Q2","e":"net","d":"2022-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"James Fish","x":"And given that environment, they're struggling with huge price increases, particularly on systems in local -- in dollars plus the currency translation and their budgets are fairly flat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/cloudflare-inc-net-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"NET 2022 Q3","e":"net","d":"2022-11-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"What I think actually ended up happening was that that tailwind did not materialize, and that the threat that the Russians are coming turned out to not be something which was showed up outside of the Ukrainian theater.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/03/cloudflare-inc-net-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"NET 2022 Q3","e":"net","d":"2022-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"Similarly, if you are a seat-based model, as you're seeing some companies, you know, do layoffs or, at a minimum, not expand their seats, that is something that is challenging in the current environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/03/cloudflare-inc-net-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"NET 2022 Q4","e":"net","d":"2023-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alex Henderson","x":"I know back in November, you raised prices for the first time, and it was at a decade, which is amazing in and of itself.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/09/cloudflare-net-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2022 Q4","e":"net","d":"2023-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"The primary goal of the price increase, which was really only for our pay-as-you-go business, which is well less than 20% of Cloudflare's revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/09/cloudflare-net-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q1","e":"net","d":"2023-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"One last month called us \"The first cloud infrastructure company built for the age of AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/cloudflare-net-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q2","e":"net","d":"2023-08-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thomas Seifert","x":"And that's why we are so confident that the business model is going to hold, and it's one of the reasons why we're able to -- AI's capex ratio down for the year despite the fact that AI workloads are putting -- are being put more and more on our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/03/cloudflare-net-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q2","e":"net","d":"2023-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Seifert","x":"We're making good progress, both in terms of restructuring our team, in terms of adapting our tactics and strategies, how we move upmarket.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/03/cloudflare-net-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q3","e":"net","d":"2023-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thomas Seifert","x":"Despite having begun to invest in the enormous AI opportunity in front of us, with the planned rollout of GPUs to more than 100 cities by the end of this year, we expect network capex to be 8% to 10% of revenue in fiscal 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/cloudflare-net-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q3","e":"net","d":"2023-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Thomas Seifert","x":"We will remain prudent in hiring as we continue to invest in broadening and deepening the usage of AI and automation across our operations to drive higher productivity and greater efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/cloudflare-net-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q3","e":"net","d":"2023-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"…us, is because at core Cloudflare's incredibly good as a routing and scheduling engine, that's how we're able to deliver the very high gross margins that we have compared with some others in the space, is that we just get a much higher degree of utilization, and we pass that on to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/cloudflare-net-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q3","e":"net","d":"2023-11-02","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"And that's sort of my sneaky feature that I think is going to be pretty disruptive because you can use our vector database, whether you're using the rest of Cloudflare's AI systems, becomes a really great function for AI users, who are wanting to do fine tuning.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/03/cloudflare-net-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q4","e":"net","d":"2024-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"The breadth and potential impact of the use cases we are seeing with Workers AI are extraordinary, and we're super excited about the opportunity to establish Workers AI's serverless model built on Cloudflare's trusted global network as the best infrastructure for running AI inference tasks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/09/cloudflare-net-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2023 Q4","e":"net","d":"2024-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"You know, I'll start with a -- in a place that you might not expect, which is that our success in the zero-trust market has actually helped empower our ability to invest in -- in the developer platform and especially the AI market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/09/cloudflare-net-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q1","e":"net","d":"2024-05-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"I'm proud of the fact that our team has been able to continue to build our network, service larger and larger customers, and launch entirely new categories of products including in the AI space, while remaining disciplined with our capex, gross margin, operating margin, and cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/02/cloudflare-net-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q1","e":"net","d":"2024-05-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"That then frees up our ability to invest that capex in other areas, including in the AI space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/02/cloudflare-net-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q2","e":"net","d":"2024-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Seifert","x":"…especially for existing customers that transition into this structure and anniversary-ing the price increase to our Pro and business pay-as-you-go plans last year. For the next several quarters, we expect new customers to contribute a higher percentage of our overall year-over-year revenue…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/02/cloudflare-net-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q2","e":"net","d":"2024-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"So, we're about a year after a price increase across our pay-as-you-go business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/02/cloudflare-net-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q3","e":"net","d":"2024-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Seifert","x":"…of review recognition, as well as deferred revenue, TRPO, and cash flow and anniversarying the price increase to our Pro and business PayGo plans last year. As we mentioned last quarter, we expect new customers to contribute a higher percentage of our overall year-over-year revenue growth for…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/cloudflare-net-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q4","e":"net","d":"2025-02-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"But this idea that the only way to win in AI was to spend hundreds of billions or even trillions of dollars, I think DeepSeek shook that foundation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/07/cloudflare-net-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2024 Q4","e":"net","d":"2025-02-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"And again, that either means that we can capture that as margin, or we can pass that on to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/07/cloudflare-net-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q2","e":"net","d":"2025-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"And the AI companies are spending billions of dollars on salaries for that.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Cloudflare-Inc-NET-US-Q2-2025-Earnin.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q2","e":"net","d":"2025-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"…the fact that so much of the Internet sits behind us and inherently those agents are going to be passing through us, that we have an opportunity to help define what those rails are that the agents will ride on and take some fees from those transactions as we've helped facilitate them and make…","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Cloudflare-Inc-NET-US-Q2-2025-Earnin.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q2","e":"net","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"Consolidating on to Cloudflare's unified platform will improve the customer's overall security posture and simplify their architecture, while also realizing a roughly 60% cost savings.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2025/q2/CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT_-Cloudflare-Inc-NET-US-Q2-2025-Earnin.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q3","e":"net","d":"2025-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"The agents of the future will inherently have to pass through our network and abide by its rules.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/cloudflare-net-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q3","e":"net","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"The agency is standardizing its network and security platform on Cloudflare, displacing over a dozen legacy point solutions and generating more than $10 million in annual cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/cloudflare-net-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q3","e":"net","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"This customer chose Cloudflare for the operational simplicity of our unified platform that delivers both superior performance and significant cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/31/cloudflare-net-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q4","e":"net","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"This customer was facing a massive increase in AI scraping, which was crushing their network and driving up infrastructure costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/cloudflare-net-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q4","e":"net","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"If AI agents are the new users of the Internet, Cloudflare is the platform they run on and the network they pass through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/cloudflare-net-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q4","e":"net","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"It's not a coincidence that most so-called vibe coding platforms are either built on Cloudflare Workers or have us as their preferred deployment target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/cloudflare-net-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2025 Q4","e":"net","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Matt Hedberg","x":"Obviously, the hyperscalers are spending more on CapEx and being punished for that, and at the same time, SaaS vendors are being punished for AI disruption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/cloudflare-net-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"Traditional CDNs chased things that drove lots of bandwidth—video streaming, live events.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"We have a fleet of GPUs and all the tools with Cloudflare Workers and Workers AI to build and use those tools ourselves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"That is one reason we see significantly higher utilization across our GPU resources than hyperscalers and even AI labs are able to drive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"If you think about the roughly hundreds of billions of requests that pass through Cloudflare, Inc. in any given second, some percentage of those could carry a micro-payment because they drive infrastructure load.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"This is not a cost-cutting exercise or an assessment of the individuals’ performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"We are also pairing the directness of these measures with severance packages that lead the industry because we want to ensure that those who have invested their time and talents in Cloudflare, Inc.’s mission are taken care of as we move into the next phase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q1","e":"net","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"Driven by the boom in AI-powered vibe coding, this company has seen explosive growth, and Cloudflare, Inc. has become core to their infrastructure, intelligently routing billions of daily requests across the globe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/cloudflare-net-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q2","e":"net","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"And if you're selling what is just commodity compute, if you're basically letting a AI company use your balance sheet and your credit rating in order to buy servers that are the same as everybody else's servers, then like that's just not attractive business for us.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/NET-US-CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT-Cloudflare-IncNETUS-Q2-2026-Earnings-Call-6August2026-500-ET-PM-07-08-2026-2026-08-07-0.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q2","e":"net","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Colville","x":"One of the decisions that you've made is not to participate in the AI CapEx kind of arms race.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/NET-US-CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT-Cloudflare-IncNETUS-Q2-2026-Earnings-Call-6August2026-500-ET-PM-07-08-2026-2026-08-07-0.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q2","e":"net","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"…small fee, fractions of a penny for every request that goes through, but for the request that pass through that traffic, because somebody has to pay for the bandwidth, somebody has to pay for the server, somebody has to pay for the people doing the work to create the content. And I think that","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/NET-US-CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT-Cloudflare-IncNETUS-Q2-2026-Earnings-Call-6August2026-500-ET-PM-07-08-2026-2026-08-07-0.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q2","e":"net","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Josef Seifert","x":"Excluded from these non-GAAP results were severance and other restructuring charges of $151 million for the second quarter, of which $99 million was paid in the second quarter.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/NET-US-CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT-Cloudflare-IncNETUS-Q2-2026-Earnings-Call-6August2026-500-ET-PM-07-08-2026-2026-08-07-0.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q2","e":"net","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Josef Seifert","x":"For full year 2026, we now expect severance and other restructuring charges of up to $165 million, with up to $130 million expected to be cash related.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/NET-US-CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT-Cloudflare-IncNETUS-Q2-2026-Earnings-Call-6August2026-500-ET-PM-07-08-2026-2026-08-07-0.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q2","e":"net","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"My EA is using some of the vibe coding platforms in order to build tools in order to run things around her house and she's writing code and deploying it to Cloudflare.","url":"https://cloudflare.net/files/doc_financials/2026/q2/NET-US-CORRECTED-TRANSCRIPT-Cloudflare-IncNETUS-Q2-2026-Earnings-Call-6August2026-500-ET-PM-07-08-2026-2026-08-07-0.pdf"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q3","e":"net","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"When the world's biggest cloud operators build next-generation AI infrastructure, they trust Cloudflare to protect it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/cloudflare-net-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q3","e":"net","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Fatima Boolani","x":"Just if you can give us some concrete examples of what the aftermath of some of those difficult restructuring moves has been in terms of your ability and your successes in operating the business at this level.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/cloudflare-net-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NET 2026 Q3","e":"net","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Prince","x":"And I'm proud of the fact that we had an incredibly generous severance package.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/cloudflare-net-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[39,1,9493,0,0,0